      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS JO (1) finished fourth last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 400m at this track, taking a Grade 5 in a flying 22.52. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. FRED'S FURY (2) was below best at his last start when 6th at Ballarat following a win (22.67) at this track two back. Solid record here at the distance winning four races. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Should be thereabouts. JAMES'S ENTITY (4) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 22.69 beating Lara Moon. Sure to measure up. UNDERCOVER GUY (7) should be thereabouts after narrowly missing most recently.",
